    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Moonlight's Kiss",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "A moon hag in an area illuminated by moonlight gains a +2 status bonus to AC and initiative rolls. In the light of a full moon, they're Quickened, and can use the extra action only to Stride or Strike. If the moon hag has a fly Speed, they can use the extra action to Fly as well.\n\nAny time they're outside of the oubliette or in area C7 they are in moonlight.",
